{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0593_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f2fd0289765509a4bf4a9925ff09790515a1d5c21b99823fc209964cd04ebbc9", "ja": "（コスプレグラビア企画の撮影は無事に終了。\n犬の衣装を着た奈緒の活き活きとした姿が撮れた！）", "zh": "（Cosplay写真企划的拍摄顺利结束。成功拍下了穿着狗狗服装、活力十足的奈绪！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0593_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "88c22caf46250ae3289aa792680f05fc7590a97b1c360a355a1c06023643a4c9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……大変です！\n私、とんでもないことに気づいたんです……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……不好了！\n我发现了一件不得了的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0593_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ea8b71ebba5c25e07587026d8d8dd617323c664906a0117413a816d8c50dd23d", "ja": "とんでもないこと？", "zh": "不得了的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0593_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "0d47c3b8ddb7154a84977c1da271ae94ac30737ba3bb6c1adb127e5a227e6a9a", "ja": "はい……。\nこ、この衣装、かなり危険かもしれません……！", "zh": "是……。\n这、这套服装，可能相当危险……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0593_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ef5c69447afb56ec0940dfc11b7145c9b16cd8d761a02fc2452565a95c4b7f8a", "ja": "えっ、どういうことだ？", "zh": "诶，这是怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0593_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "b38fcfa9ccf7f947db303d03a9335e9166e734856f0934cee638ac1bcd48b8ff", "ja": "これを着てから、なんやウズウズするっていうか……\nどうにも、走りたくてしゃーないんです！", "zh": "穿上这个之后，总觉得浑身躁动不安……\n不知怎么的，就是特别想跑，根本停不下来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0593_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "a39663996297c450cda1ed1609d26f07149fc62d0981d399cef87220817a78d3", "ja": "もしかして……衣装に宿った動物霊の仕業じゃ？\nアカン。このままやと、わた……私……うわ～っ！", "zh": "难道是……寄宿在这套服装里的动物灵魂在作祟？  \n糟了。这样下去的话，我……我……呜哇——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0593_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "123cb7ff5969ea692b22968fb682f0fc33d653923a2f693666e3c80a4570497e", "ja": "「ウー……ガルルルル、{$P$}さん\nサンポツレテケ、ゴホウビモワスレルナ……ワン」", "zh": "“呜……嗷呜呜呜，{$P$}先生，带我去散步，别忘了给我奖励……汪”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0593_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1b43d967c8be57ad0e6e75b2fff29565070443073469b57352a94d0c8af4e53b", "ja": "散歩……ご褒美……？", "zh": "散步……奖励……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0593_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "c4f30f05e7b26eca3bc86ea0a77c16245394d327998234d0595bb6434ed2959b", "ja": "もー、{$P$}さん、ノリ悪いですよ！\n渾身のボケをスルーとか、重罪もんです！", "zh": "真是的，{$P$}先生，太不捧场了吧！\n居然无视我倾尽全力的装傻，简直罪大恶极！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0593_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "f27a035743a8d08b2f0923dc43a567bd77d692533d45fc54e84a54eee20949c6", "ja": "犬の演技もしたのに……\nさすがに恥ずかしなってくるやないですか。", "zh": "我连狗狗的表演都做了……  \n这下也真的开始觉得有点丢人了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0593_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0836cd12c95c35819493201b77eedd1a80b25d5aa310948847bf318ab50da5d1", "ja": "そうだよな。ごめんごめん。……さっきの撮影も\n頑張ってたし、散歩とご褒美は必要か。", "zh": "是啊。抱歉抱歉……你刚才拍摄的时候也很努力，散步和奖励还是需要的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0593_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "5fb466748d16679e0ba23f4818659f523fb5f3c4f42e7e6a2553b03419b045ab", "ja": "やったー！　それじゃ、劇場まで歩いて帰りませんか？\nそれが散歩代わりってことで。", "zh": "太好啦——！那我们走路回剧场好不好？\n就当是散步了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0593_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "7ee5f17cf41c821d634cb21a9ababacc74906bd105d8f8c7439d0ad1e286eaf2", "ja": "ご褒美は、最近できたご飯屋さんなんてどうです？\n寄り道になるけど……散歩って、そんなもんですよね！", "zh": "奖励是去最近新开的小饭馆，怎么样？\n虽然要顺路绕过去……但散步不就是这样嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0593_1014_p", "source_sha256": "fe6faff94edd144057256e66502527d74bbd4528a80f43995d164184a292d58f", "ja": "なんか、いつもと変わらない気がするけど……。\n奈緒がそれでいいなら。歩いて帰ろうか。", "zh": "总觉得，好像和往常没什么两样……  \n奈绪觉得这样就好，那我们走回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0593_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "ea7bbe15bca9f29401cc98fb2de99de1dcae709efc9b300e3875b0e92b42a0c8", "ja": "えへへ。ほな、すぐ着替えてきますね！\n散歩とご飯……散歩とご飯～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿。那我马上去换衣服！\n散步和吃饭……散步和吃饭～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
